  nonce: '7830'  # 7830
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: controller_routes.py:124 CNF unchanged. The filed ASP.NET repro (App.csproj + [ApiController] UsersController) on hypergumbo survey still prints '[passes] 1 pass(es) emitted output with an unsatisfied depends_on conjunct ... controller-routes-linker needs [[python, javascript, ruby, java, go, elixir, php]]'. A YAML scan finds concept: controller in csharp, kotlin, swift, fsharp, scala (as filed). It also shows NO go YAML emits controller (go-web.yaml has none), so 'go' is a spurious member too, the INV-vivit shape. MECHANISM: depends_on CNF hand-listed in the linker module instead of derived from the framework YAMLs that emit the consumed concept. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-vivit."  # 7830
